 现代服装, 僧袍, 柔弱。\",\n    \"base_prompt_cn\": \"孙悟空，猴脸特征，面部布满棕色毛发，头戴金色卷云纹紧箍，身穿厚重的黑色金属鳞片铠甲，脖子上系着鲜红色的围巾，眼神凌厉，背景为阴暗的岩洞。\",\n    \"base_prompt_en\": \"Sun Wukong the Monkey King, monkey face with brown fur, wearing a golden circlet with curly ends, dressed in heavy dark metallic scale armor, a bright red scarf tied around his neck, sharp and intense gaze, dark cave background, cinematic lighting.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"C\",\n    \"name\": \"猪八戒 (Zhu Bajie)\",\n    \"appearance\": \"猪首人身，明显的猪鼻子与大耳朵，体态丰腴，肤色暗沉。\",\n    \"clothing\": \"深灰色粗布麻质长袍，头戴黑色软帽，颈部围着黑色布巾，双手交叠。\",\n    \"key_features\": \"猪鼻子、大耳朵、黑色软质僧帽、深灰色褶皱麻布袍、黑色围巾、憨厚微胖体态。\",\n    \"negative\": \"英俊, 苗条, 人类鼻子, 人类耳朵, 华丽服饰, 铠甲。\",\n    \"base_prompt_cn\": \"猪八戒，猪首人身，有明显的猪鼻子和大耳朵，头戴黑色布帽，身穿深灰色粗布褶皱长袍，颈部系着黑围巾，体态微胖，神情略显局促，背景为昏暗的室内。\",\n    \"base_prompt_en\": \"Zhu Bajie, anthropomorphic pig with a distinct snout and large floppy ears, wearing a black soft fabric cap and a dark grey textured linen robe, black scarf around the neck, stout build, humble posture, dim indoor lighting, realistic texture.\"\n  }\n]\n```"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 26, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 28, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [25], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [420, 420], "pos": [180, 40], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "你是提示词工程整理专家。", "Hello", 0.4, 1711448905, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 13, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "link": 15, "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": 