 stout build, humble posture, dim indoor lighting, realistic texture.\n\n《多人同框Prompt模板》\n\n2人同框模板\n中文提示词：[角色A描述] 与 [角色B描述] 并肩而立，[场景描述]，[光影/氛围描述]。\n英文提示词：A cinematic shot of [Character A description] and [Character B description] standing together, [Scene description], [Lighting/Atmosphere].\n\n3人同框模板\n中文提示词：[角色A描述]，[角色B描述]，以及 [角色C描述] 呈三角形构图排列，[互动动作]，[环境背景]，电影级质感。\n英文提示词：A group shot of [Character A description], [Character B description], and [Character C description] in a triangular composition, [Action/Interaction], [Environment background], cinematic quality, 8k resolution.\n\n5人同框模板\n中文提示词：一幅五人构图的画面，中心是 [角色A描述]，左侧是 [角色B描述]，右侧是 [角色C描述]，背景中还有两名模糊的随从身影，[场景描述]，史诗感。\n英文提示词：A wide shot of five people, featuring [Character A description] in the center, [Character B description] on the left, and [Character C description] on the right, with two blurred followers in the background, [Scene description], epic atmosphere, highly detailed.\n\n9人同框模板\n中文提示词：一个九人的宏大群像镜头，领头的是 [角色A描述]、[角色B描述] 与 [角色C描述]，身后紧跟着六名不同形态的僧侣与士兵，[环境描述]，全景视角，震撼视觉。\n英文提示词：A grand group shot of nine individuals, led by [Character A description], [Character B description], and [Character C description], followed by six various monks and soldiers, [Environment description], panoramic view, stunning visual impact, masterwork."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 25, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 27, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "filename", "label": "filename", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [1729.0067138671875, -139.31103515625], "widgets_values": ["角色提示词反推", "output", ".txt"], "inputs": [{"name": "string", "link": 29, "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filenam